t": "In this kingdom, time is not a defining."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "In the realm of trivialities,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "We only speak of the insignificant,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Little things that make us laugh and sing,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Lightness of being is the path we cling."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}